WEBVTT

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:34.990
<b>Magical Girl - Hot Springs Business</b>

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:42.240
A milky-white hot spring, bubbling up
 from a 1500 meter tall mountain.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:46.370
<b>Senza Hot Spring</b>

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:46.810
"As the name suggests, Senza Hot Springs 
contains a massive bath that can hold

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:57.130
<b>Senza Hot Spring</b>

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:50.290
a thousand people at once, as well as 
another 20 different kinds of springs.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:54.530
With all this, it would be no exaggeration to
 call it the world's best hot spring," it says.

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:56.160
Wow!

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:59.500
In addition to all kinds of hot springs,

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.590
it also has a giant banquet 
hall with a stage!

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:04.260
It's highly recommended for company trips!

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:06.770
<b>Senza Hot Spring</b>

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.780
But we're going there for work, aren't we?

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:11.270
Well, just one performance during 
a karaoke competition, at least.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:18.470
<b>Tour Secret 
Hot Springs</b>

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:22.830
<b>Welcome!! 
Senza Hot Springs</b>

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:22.830
<b>Bike Rentals</b>

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:16.510
Wow, we're here!

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:18.590
There's a faint sulfur smell.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:21.410
I found the stop for the inn's bus!

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:22.820
Okay!

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:26.490
I arranged this back when 
our schedule was empty

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.530
and forgot to turn them down.

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:35.030
But we've been so busy, maybe it's good to let 
our hair down in a hot spring for once.

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:36.680
True!

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:41.580
And since this is a job request from a 
while back, you don't need to transform!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:44.300
Then we can sing...

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.510
...as girls?

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:46.500
Yeah.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.110
I'm gonna get some change 
at that stall over there.

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:51.810
Yeah!

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:55.060
It's been so long since we 
sang without transforming!

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.060
Yeah!

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:03.500
Nii-san...

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.320
Thank you.

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.210
Nii-san!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.090
My, what a coincidence!

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.830
Here for business or pleasure?

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:16.460
We have an event at the hot springs inn.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:19.160
I bet it was rough having 
to travel all this way.

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:20.470
What about you two?

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.920
We're here shooting a music video.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:24.760
We just finished up for today.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.360
Congratulations.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:32.770
<i>That's right... I haven't made much 
progress with Mohiro-chan as myself.</i>

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:35.320
<i>The appearance of my magical girl form aside,</i>

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:37.980
<i>maybe I should just reveal 
my identity already?</i>

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:41.440
<i>But that wouldn't be a very 
maidenly thing to do...</i>

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:44.980
<i>And speak of the devil, 
Mohiro-chan's right there!</i>

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:47.160
Morning.

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:49.440
Morning!

00:03:51.220 --> 00:03:54.560
L-Look, I wasn't waiting 
for you or anything.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:56.390
I was waiting for a bus with Sakuyo.

00:03:56.390 --> 00:04:01.140
We have a job here, and you just 
happened to be here when we arrived,

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.520
so it's nothing suspicious!

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.460
Huh?

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.610
<i>I guess I was a little overbearing!</i>

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:14.580
Sorry. It just feels like it's 
been so long since we talked,

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:16.690
and I got a little carried away.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.700
Let's talk more often.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:31.540
<i>My Love Power's in the red zone!</i>

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.050
<i>Please, get away!</i>

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:36.540
<i>Before my other self appears!</i>

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.540
An exorcism?

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.810
<i>Go for it, Saki! Don't abandon your dream!</i>

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.710
Wow, you were recording
 a video for your new song?

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:49.900
I can't wait to see it!

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:52.520
But it's too bad you have 
to leave already...

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.130
Yeah, it's just <i>too bad</i>, isn't it?

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:57.920
Oh, were you here, too?

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:00.370
Sakuyo-chan would have 
been better off by herself.

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:03.510
Won't having you here just drag her down?

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:08.320
Well, you see, the Magical <i>Twins</i> 
are me and Sakuyo together.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:12.550
Maybe Mohiro-chan would be better 
being Star Prince all by himself!

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:17.130
Mohiro-chan's fans all tune 
you out of his PVs anyway!

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:23.210
Mohiro, it's time to catch our train!

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:26.200
You slimy little...

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:39.420
It's raining.

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:45.010
<i>I got to talk to Mohiro-chan after so long!</i>

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.110
Let's talk more often.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.290
<i>Huh? But...</i>

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:57.780
<i>Does that mean we're no closer 
now than we were back then?</i>

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:00.520
Huh? Oh?

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:04.880
Did I forget the karaoke CD you were 
going to sing for today's event?

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:07.840
My love could change me!

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:10.750
I believe I can do anything if I try!

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:12.350
Senza Hot Spring Recital Noon Part

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.800
And for your sake, I'm sure...

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:16.510
I love you! Oh, you!

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:19.870
I can do anything!

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:22.800
Let's go, let's go! Just watch!

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:25.340
That's my "Honeyed Flash!"

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:30.280
Thank you so much, Mr. President!

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:31.530
Senza Hot Spring Recital  Afternoon Portion

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:33.250
Encore, encore!

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:33.550
<i>Huh? Nobody mentioned this!</i>

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.840
Thank you for treating us to an encore.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:45.290
Well, let's hear the president 
sing another song!

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:50.860
What a shock!

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:53.470
Nobody told us how to handle encores...

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:56.440
But I guess it's expected around here...

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:02.550
How many years has it been?

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.440
Working hard?

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:08.250
We certainly were! No thanks to you
 for forgetting our karaoke materials!

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:09.910
I'm sorry.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:12.480
But your lip-sync was great!

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:15.110
Go for it! Oh, me!

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:18.230
If only I had a magic spell...

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:19.610
I like you! Oh...

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:21.230
That's not a compliment!

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:22.290
Agreed.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.450
I think the president just 
wanted an excuse to sing.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:28.720
Yeah.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:29.800
Now, now.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.390
But the president is 
quite popular, it seems!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:38.480
Flowing, flowing I go

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:38.190
Let's stay the night here and build 
up our energy for the future!

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.280
I hear the hot springs here are great, too!

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:41.150
Knowing it would never be

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.170
Yeah!

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:44.720
You're okay in large hot springs, Saki?

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:47.020
Yeah, I'm just fine!

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.850
<i>But I'll be spending the 
whole night with Sakuyo...</i>

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:56.240
<i>Hey! What's with that 
passionate pretty-girl gaze?</i>

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:01.990
It'll be okay, right? 
I'm trusting you, okay?

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:05.450
I like this place. I like 
being alone with you, too.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:09.550
<i>What if Sakuyo gets excited and 
transforms into a man by herself?</i>

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.720
<i>I couldn't fight those muscles...</i>

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.420
No!

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:25.530
I still have feelings for you, Saki,

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:27.890
but I promise, I won't do 
anything you don't want.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:32.010
I've been curious about the baths here, 
so I'm going to head out there, okay?

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:40.130
See you later.

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:45.200
Oh? You guys...

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:50.270
Our train back got canceled due to the storm,
 so we thought we'd stay the night here.

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.880
Wow! Were the highway buses out, too?

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:56.390
Road Closed
Landslide 20 km ahead

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:56.390
Area Information

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.390
The roads are closed because 
of a landslide, apparently.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:09:00.720
<b>Kusano </b>Express

00:08:56.700 --> 00:09:01.120
We waited at the station for a while, 
but the trains didn't budge.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:05.030
Fortunately, there's nothing 
urgent in our schedules.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.360
Well, that's lucky in its own way.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.610
<b>Water of Long Life</b>

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:17.720
Huh? Sakuyo's not here.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:20.000
Is there another bath here, maybe?

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:24.360
<b>Water of Long Life</b>

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.970
Oh, darn it...

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.380
At this time, the bath is 
<b>men only
</b>Water of Long Life

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:34.380
<b>Water of Long Life</b>

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:30.360
I finally found it.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:33.010
The place is so big and 
winding, I got lost...

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:36.360
Oh, I can't go in right now?

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:38.640
At this time, the bath is 
<b>men only
</b>Water of Long Life

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:38.060
Too bad...

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:43.380
How could I say that to Sakuyo?

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:45.990
It's like I don't trust her at all.

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:50.470
Why am I always like this?

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.380
What would Mohiro-chan do in my situation?

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:56.050
Mohiro-chan...

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:02.670
No, not here!

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:03.870
<b>Cold Bath</b>

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:05.850
Over there!

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.410
Mohiro-chan?!

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:13.440
No, then I'd turn back...

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:15.720
But what's Mohiro-chan 
doing in the girl's bath?

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:22.960
<i>He's coming closer!</i>

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:25.640
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:30.890
Why, fancy meeting you here!

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:34.510
<i>Why does he look like he's enjoying himself?</i>

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:39.160
<i>No, don't look!</i>

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.100
<i>Wait, that's right...</i>

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:44.250
<i>I have a man's body now. I don't 
have to feel embarrassed.</i>

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.790
I hear this spring is good for the muscles.

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:53.200
Wait!

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:57.330
<i>Oh, gosh! Is Mohiro-chan 
excited about the hot spring?</i>

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.920
He's so cute!

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.210
Wait, is it okay to be going along with this?

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:06.270
Oh, your train got held up 
and you had to stay here?

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:12.100
<i>But how'd I end up in this 
"pervert's dream" situation?</i>

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:16.420
<i>Anyway, I'll have to maintain my 
transformation if it kills me,</i>

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:19.470
<i>then find a moment when I can slip away.</i>

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.100
<i>I'm not sure where to look...</i>

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:28.090
<i>But he really is beautiful.</i>

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:31.380
<i>That defined collarbone. 
Those toned muscles.</i>

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.330
<i>Those pecs. Those abs.</i>

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.310
<i>And...</i>

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:39.650
<i>No, no! Don't do it!</i>

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:46.220
<i>It's from that time.</i>

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:53.730
<i>It left a scar?</i>

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:57.480
<i>I see. I left a scar on Mohiro-chan.</i>

00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:59.660
<i>I'm sorry about that...</i>

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:05.720
<i>But from now on, I'll protect Mohiro-chan, 
so that he never gets hurt again.</i>

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:13.340
<i>No, no!</i>

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:16.880
<i>Anyway, what's Mohiro-chan 
doing in the girl's bath?</i>

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:21.240
<i>Maybe he made a mistake due to 
his natural absentmindedness?</i>

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:27.510
To our guests: 
<b>From 4:00 PM on
</b>This bath is reserved
<b>For men
</b>The next shift will occur at 8:00 PM

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:24.750
<i>What the hell?!</i>

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:27.510
<i>That explains why Sakuyo 
wasn't here, at least!</i>

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:33.010
It'll be okay, right? 
I'm trusting you, okay?

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.650
But I still...

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:40.740
I wanna take her!

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:50.760
So cold!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.800
<b>One Hour Later</b>

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.160
<i>M-Mohiro-chan...</i>

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:08.430
<i>How can you stay in the bath for so long?</i>

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:13.050
<i>Crap! My Love Power for 
Mohiro-chan is dropping!</i>

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:21.980
Oh, no!

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.300
Oh, no!

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:32.720
Oh, no!

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:37.720
What? Saki's still not back yet...

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:40.920
<i>I-I'm reaching my limit!</i>

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:46.590
What is it? What now?

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:51.000
What's going on?

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:58.530
<i>The hot spring triathlon 
for traditional men.</i>

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.490
<b>Cold Water Bath</b>

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:08.440
No! Not the cold water bath!

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:10.610
I w-wanna stay here!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:28.630
It'll take more than this to out-sauna me!

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:40.070
Huh? Mohiro-kun?

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:56.290
A manly competition.

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:59.790
<i>No, that's not how I meant it...</i>

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:12.820
Love Power, revive!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.580
<i>I can't do it...</i>

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:24.980
<i>No, can't do it.</i>

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.270
<i>No, can't...</i>

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:33.350
<i>I underestimated Mohiro-chan's endurance.</i>

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.670
<i>Finally heading out?</i>

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.960
A manly competition.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:51.450
One, two, three, four.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.830
Two, two, three, four.

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.780
<i>She's still not here...</i>

00:15:58.190 --> 00:15:59.940
<i>Where are you, Saki?</i>

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:03.640
Perfect timing.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:05.900
Dinner's at 6.

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:08.250
Saki still hasn't come back.

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:23.110
I burned for you, burned myself out.

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:25.360
All that's left is pure white ash.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:32.140
<i>That's right, Mohiro-kun and 
the others are staying here.</i>

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:34.510
<i>Maybe Saki-chan met up with them?</i>

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:37.240
<i>Where's my brother's room?</i>

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:38.690
<i>I don't know.</i>

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:40.970
<i>Ah, but I passed him in the bath earlier.</i>

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.310
<i>He was in the sauna.</i>

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:44.590
<i>Oh, I think there was 
another man in there, too.</i>

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:46.200
Saki!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.660
Looks like I lose. You're incredible!!

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:59.820
I could stay in here another 
500 billion years!

00:16:56.910 --> 00:17:01.410
<b>This one part turned female again</b>

00:16:59.820 --> 00:17:01.400
<i>Uh-oh. I'm at my limit.</i>

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:07.620
<i>What would my brother think if 
Saki's identity were revealed now?</i>

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:19.130
For my love for Saki!

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:29.500
This should be a shortcut...

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.620
What's going on here?

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:39.790
What is all this?!

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.450
<b>(Reserved) Demon Party</b>

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:48.290
I don't have time for you fools!

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:13.940
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:16.380
<i>I'm at... my limit.</i>

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.410
<b>Water of Long Life</b>

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:47.300
Saki!

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:55.180
Nii-san, are you in there?

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:56.240
Don't worry.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:59.740
You've got a call from home!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.340
<b>Water of Long Life</b>

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:29.150
Isn't this...

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:53.330
Are you okay?

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:57.790
Don't worry. My brother didn't see you.

00:19:58.150 --> 00:20:01.270
You saved me? Thank you...

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:05.060
Um, I'm sorry about befo—

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:08.510
Next time, let's have our 
bath together, okay?

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:10.910
S-Sure!

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:13.270
<b>Senza Hot Spring - Natural Hot Spring</b>

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:17.840
There's been some trouble at another job, 
so I'm going back without you.

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:19.500
The trains are apparently running again.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:21.840
Huh? Really?

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:23.120
Be careful!

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:26.800
Sorry! Enjoy your hot springs trip!

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:28.390
Okay!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:36.580
My heart is so full of you

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:34.750
Senza Hot Spring Recital  Evening Portion

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:41.350
I can't drive you out

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:49.680
<b>Sigh...</b>

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:58.540
Next up, the karaoke tournament.

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:02.450
Our first song is request 01.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:04.580
Saki-san and Mohiro-san...

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:05.960
"Rain of Tears"!

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:09.450
What? What?

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:12.260
It's a request from Konami-san to Saki-san!

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:14.790
Well, get singing!

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:35.340
It's been a while.
Let's sing, Mohiro-chan.

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:48.140
I fell hard for your kindness!

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.980
For many long years...

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:23.170
<b>Karaoke King</b>

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:20.740 --> 00:23:23.160
<i>Today's my karaoke date with Mohiro.</i>

00:23:24.760 --> 00:23:26.540
<i>What's with that awful song?</i>

00:23:26.540 --> 00:23:27.870
<i>Who's singing that?</i>

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:31.380
Next time, "Magical Girl - Lesson."

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Magical Girl - Lesson</b>

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:34.450
<i>Have you ever felt Mohiro?</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Illustration: Monokubo
